<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Acceso Suspendido - Gig Manager</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: white;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 90%;
      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.3);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 40px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.25);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    .icon-box {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.3);
      color: #f43f5e;
      border-radius: 20px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: white;
    }
    p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.2);
      color: #fb7185;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .btn-logout {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon-box">🚫</div>
    <div class="badge">Suministro / Acceso Suspendido</div>
    <h1>Servicio Temporalmente Interrumpido</h1>
    <p>
      El acceso para la empresa <strong><%= current_company&.name %></strong> ha sido suspendido por concepto de mensualidad o mantenimiento de cuenta pendiente.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #cbd5e1; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px;">
      Por favor regulariza tu pago con el Superadmin para reactivar tu suministro e ingresar inmediatamente a tus eventos e inventarios.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 28px;">
      <%= button_to "Cerrar Sesión", destroy_user_session_path, method: :delete, class: "btn-logout" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
